    "Title": "Microstate pKa values",
    "Description": "Predicts microstate pKa values, which set the ionisation state a molecule adopts at physiological pH and therefore influence solubility, permeability and binding. Mayr and colleagues addressed the shortage of measured pKa data by pretraining a graph neural network on a large body of calculated values and then transferring to the smaller experimental set. Alongside the prediction the model reports the spread across an ensemble, giving a direct read on where it is least certain.",
